{"id":"n3-108","title":"もし～ても","romaji":"moshi ~ temo","jlptLevel":3,"shortExplanation":"Express a hypothetical situation or assumption with the nuance of 'even if'.","longExplanation":"The もし～ても grammar point is used to describe a situation in which even if the stated condition is true, the result or decision does not change. It can be translated as 'even if', 'no matter if', or 'suppose ~'.","formation":"もし + Verb-て form + も / もし + い-Adjective(く) + ても / もし + な-Adjective/Noun + でも","examples":[{"jp":"もし雨が降っても、ピクニックに行きます。","romaji":"Moshi ame ga futtemo, pikunikku ni ikimasu.","en":"Even if it rains, we will go on a picnic.","words":[{"surface":"もし","vocabId":"1912410","reading":"もし"},{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"降っ","vocabId":"1282790","reading":"ふる","baseForm":"降る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ピクニック","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行き","vocabId":"1578790","reading":"いき","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,5]},{"jp":"もし彼が謝っても、まだ怒っているでしょう。","romaji":"Moshi kare ga ayamattemo, mada okotteiru deshou.","en":"Even if he apologizes, I will still be angry.","words":[{"surface":"もし","vocabId":"1912410","reading":"もし"},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"謝っ","vocabId":"1323010","reading":"あやまる","baseForm":"謝る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"怒っ","vocabId":"1445690","reading":"おこる","baseForm":"怒る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,5]},{"jp":"もし試験に合格しても、まだ勉強を続けます。","romaji":"Moshi shiken ni goukaku shitemo, mada benkyou wo tsuzukemasu.","en":"Even if I pass the exam, I will still continue studying.","words":[{"surface":"もし","vocabId":"1912410","reading":"もし"},{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"合格","vocabId":"1284600","reading":"ごうかく"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだ","vocabId":"1527110","reading":"まだ"},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"続け","vocabId":"1405800","reading":"つづける","baseForm":"続ける"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,6]},{"jp":"もし彼女が遅く来ても、待っています。","romaji":"Moshi kanojo ga osoku kite mo, matteimasu.","en":"Even if she comes late, I will wait.","words":[{"surface":"もし","vocabId":"1912410","reading":"もし"},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅く","vocabId":"1421970","reading":"おそい","baseForm":"遅い"},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい","baseForm":"来る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"待っ","vocabId":"1410590","reading":"まつ","baseForm":"待つ"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[0,6]}],"formalityLevel":"neutral","usageNote":"Pairs もし with ても - a plain hypothetical \"even if\".","family":{"id":"even-if","name":"Even If (Hypothetical Concession)","relatedPoints":["n3-035","n3-069","n3-078","n1-199","n1-140"]}}